            <title>[KYLIN-5608] [Aggregation Group API] Indexes added via the Aggregate Group API, the order of dimensions displayed on the page is inconsistent with the order passed in by the api</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5608</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Aggregation Group API&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Calling the newly added index of the aggregation group API, the order of dimensions displayed on the page is inconsistent with the order passed in by the api&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13542294">KYLIN-5608</key>
            <summary>[Aggregation Group API] Indexes added via the Aggregate Group API, the order of dimensions displayed on the page is inconsistent with the order passed in by the api</summary>
