                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17739596" author="JIRAUSER297438" created="Mon, 3 Jul 2023 11:54:44 +0000"  >&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Because the dimension order will affect the generated index, it is necessary to ensure that the dimension order stored in the metadata database is consistent with the dimension order entered by the user calling the API. Currently, when parsing the dimension name -&amp;gt; dimension id, the TreeSet is used to save the dimension name, so the collection will be iterated according to the natural order instead of the incoming order.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Fixdesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Fix design&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;change TreeSet to LinkedHashSet.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
